@startuml
title Licence purchase with UPI - MVP2 automated (PAY-001..005)
actor Doctor
participant "Desktop app" as APP
participant "Portal (phone)" as POR
participant "Licence API" as API
database "Licence DB" as DB
participant "Razorpay" as RZ
participant "UPI app\n(GPay/PhonePe/Paytm)" as UPI
participant "SMS/Email" as MSG
Doctor -> APP : Buy / Renew
APP --> Doctor : open browser, or QR of purchase URL\n(with activation request code)
Doctor -> POR : choose plan, phone OTP, GSTIN optional
POR -> API : POST /v1/orders
API -> DB : order (status=created)
API -> RZ : create order
RZ --> API : order_id
API --> POR : order_id
POR -> RZ : Checkout (UPI Intent / QR / collect)
RZ -> UPI : payment request
Doctor -> UPI : approve with UPI PIN
UPI --> RZ : success
RZ --> POR : client callback (not trusted)
RZ -> API : webhook payment.captured (HMAC)
API -> API : verify HMAC, idempotent on payment_id
API -> DB : order=paid, licence issued, invoice no. (one transaction)
API -> MSG : licence key + response code + GST invoice PDF
POR -> API : poll order status
API --> POR : paid + licence key + response code/QR
Doctor -> APP : enter key (online) or response code (offline)
@enduml
